     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Adults: prednisone 0.5-2.0 mg/kg/day or dexamethasone 40 mg/day for 4 days; prednisone ≤ 6 wks incl taper."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
